<title>USA: Mine Safety adopts shareholder rights plan.</title>
<headline>Mine Safety adopts shareholder rights plan.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mine Safety Appliances Co said Monday its board of directors had adopted a shareholder rights plan designed to &quot;deter coercive takeover tactics&quot;.</p>
</text>
